# Facts about Tobias Fennick.

@fact tobias.scholarship
tier: surface
text: A farmer's son on a turnip scholarship, built like a barn door and gentle as a lamb.

@fact tobias.plants
tier: surface
text: He talks to plants. Worryingly, they seem to answer.

@fact tobias.ma
tier: personal
hint: Ask about harvest at home.
unlock: seen(tobias_homesick) > 0
text: His mother runs the farm alone at harvest. It's the first harvest he has ever missed.

@fact tobias.gerald
tier: personal
hint: Ask about the mandrake in the hat.
unlock: seen(tobias_godparent) > 0
text: He is raising a mandrake called Gerald, who wears a knitted hat and screams softly.

@fact tobias.moonflowers
tier: personal
hint: Get close, and ask what he'd stand in a storm for.
unlock: rel(tobias) >= 12
text: The greenhouse moonflowers bloom once every eleven years. He would stand in a storm for them.

@fact tobias.blight
tier: secret
hint: Home may be having a bad year.
unlock: seen(tobias_bad_harvest) > 0
text: Blight took his family's harvest. Thirty crowns stood between them and a hungry winter.

@fact tobias.dancing
tier: personal
hint: Ask him about the Midwinter Ball.
unlock: seen(tobias_dance_lessons) > 0
text: He practised waltzing with a broom before the Midwinter Ball. The broom complained.

@fact tobias.after
tier: personal
hint: Ask what he'll do after graduation.
unlock: seen(tobias_home_or_here) > 0
text: His mother expects him home on the farm after graduation. It was always the plan; he isn't sure any more that it's his.
